The wants of our patrons continue to increase, and in order to accommodate our growth we are compelled to make more room on the second floor. The improvements will be begun on the 21st of August, and in order to make room for the carpenters we must clear this floor of the goods we have in stock now, and in danger of being red by dust and otherwise we propose to sacrifice it for your benefit.

You do not need blankets just now, but you will require covering in less than two weeks, and won't pay you extra now, when you can buy a Wool BLANKET when soon can buy the celebrated Jacquard BLANKETS for $4.00 when you can buy the $5 Sacramento BLANKET for $3.00;

Woolen BLANKET for $1.50 now, when you can buy the $5.00 Woolen BLANKET for $2.50;

when you can buy the $10.00 Climax BLANKET.

CURTAINS are kept on this floor, and must suffer the general slaughter.

LACE CURTAINS that were $3.00 a window now so at $1.50;

LACE CURTAINS that were $4.00 a window now so at $2.00;

LACE CURTAINS that were $2.00 a window now go for $1.00;

LACE CURTAINS that were $5.00 a window now go for $2.50.

CURTAIN-RODS, with brass trimmings complete, only $1.00.

MUST HAVE THE ROOM.

And our prices on JERSEYS are reduced with a view of moving them rapidly.

Our 50c JERSEYS reduced to 25c.;

Our Wool BLANKET JERSEY reduced to 50c.;

Our 75c Wool JERSEYS reduced to 50c.;

Our $1.00 Wool Braided-front JERSEYS reduced to 75c.;

Our $1.50 Wool Plated-front JERSEYS reduced to $1.00;

Our $2.50 Wool Braided-front JERSEYS reduced to $1.50.

The latest style checked JERSEYS worth $2.00 only $1.50.

IMMENSE SACRIFICE OF ALL SUMMER GOODS.

ELECTRIC LAWNS reduced to 5c. yard;

Remnants of LAWNS, 2c. a yard;

CRINKLED SUCCEEDS reduced to 5c. a yard;

LACE BUNTINGS reduced to 7c. a yard;

FRENCH SATINS reduced to 5c. a yard;

Elmo Sheer INDIA LINEN reduced to 8c.

ORGANDIE LAWNS reduced to 10c. yard;

CHENISETTES reduced to 10c., 12c., 15c.;

SATINS, Persian styles, reduced to 7c.

DARK CALICOS, 5c. yard.

TOWELS.

Pure Linen Grape pattern TOWELS, 5c.

Pure linen Damask TOWELS, 8c. apiece;

Pure Linen Checked TOWELS, 10c. apiece;

Pure Vine Damask TOWELS, 15c. apiece;

Plain White Damask bordered fringe TOWELS only 25c.

SHIRTS.

We have IN stock all sizes of our widely celebrated 50c. small PLAIN BOSOM shirts. You cannot get elsewhere an inferior article than is being sold now at equally good prices, ours: there is no SHIRT in the city elsewhere equal to ours. Our justly-popular as small PLATED BOSOM SHIRT is a fast seller. We warrant it made of good cotton and pure linen for bosom and cuffs. sizes IN stock. 75c.

Gentlemen's Y. K. SCARFS now 25c. apiece.

REID & CO.,
717 Main street.
